						$$renderer.push(`<p>Hello <a href="#top" class="text-primary-600 dark:text-primary-500 font-medium hover:underline">@designteam</a> Let's schedule a kick-off meeting and workshop this week. It would be great to gather everyone involved in the design project. Let me know about your availability in the thread.</p> <p>Looking forward to it! Thanks.</p>`);
