  else if (i % 3 == 0)
    console.log("Fizz");
  else if (i % 5 == 0)
    console.log("Buzz");
  else
    console.log(i);
}</code></pre><p>Learn more about all components from the <a href="https://flowbite-svelte.com/docs/pages/quickstart">Flowbite-Svelte Docs</a>.</p>`;

